chaddr (1.0.3) testing; urgency=medium

  * Renew: always propagate the freshly allocated Elastic IP; the address-panel
    selection applies only to Apply, not Renew (removed reallocate_profile
    new_override and GUI override on Renew)
  * Privilege: batch privileged file writes in apply/renew so multiple protected
    paths share one elevation prompt; prefer sudo -n when credentials are cached,
    then sudo, pkexec, gksudo, or kdesudo
  * Apply: when the profile old address equals the selected new IP, still scan
    spare/history candidates in file, hosts, and zone handlers
  * GUI: fix Ctrl+C and Ctrl+A in read-only log and diagnostics panes (STC focus
    and explicit copy shortcuts)
  * Packaging: add gui/editor.py and types/plain_file.py to chaddr/meson.build

